          adapter-vercel's file tracer match our own config and repo
          globs, never user input. Not in the production bundle.
        expires: 2027-01-14T00:00:00.000Z
        created: 2026-11-05T14:56:33.000Z
    - eslint-plugin-svelte > *:
        reason: >-
          No fix short of minimatch 11, which none of these tools
