  SNYK-JS-SVELTEJSKIT-21347777:
    - '@sveltejs/kit':
        reason: >-
          Fixed in @sveltejs/kit 2.70.4, which we run: the security
          backport in sveltejs/kit#17620, released 2026-11-05. Snyk
          still lists only 3.0.0 as fixed; drop this once it records 2.70.4.
        expires: 2027-01-14T00:00:00.000Z
        created: 2026-11-05T14:58:20.000Z
    - '@sveltejs/adapter-vercel > @sveltejs/kit':
        reason: >-
          Fixed in @sveltejs/kit 2.70.4, which we run: the security
